      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just weird. i look at my old posts and my old videos and i don’t even recognize that person. it’s like that version of me actually died and someone just put a hollow shell in its place to keep up appearances. i feel like i’m just a glitch in the system now, just taking up space and waiting for the server to crash. what’s even the point of keeping the simulation running when the real person is already gone?",
